@fact nessa.editor
# en: Editor of the Lumen Ledger, with a quill that writes on its own.
text [e5df5e] = 《流明纪事报》的主编，有一支会自己写字的羽毛笔。

@fact nessa.quill
# en: Left unsupervised, her quill starts inventing the news.
text [e4c012] = 一旦没人看着，她的羽毛笔就会开始编新闻。
# en: In your second year, visit the Ledger Office in the evening.
hint [0ac63d] = 第二年时，傍晚去《流明纪事报》编辑部。

@fact nessa.interview
# en: Nobody has interviewed the headmistress in twenty years. She means to be the first.
text [0599a6] = 二十年来没有人采访过院长。她打算做第一个。
# en: Become friends with her.
hint [af2e8a] = 和她交朋友。

@fact nessa.string
# en: Her office wall is covered in red string around a sketch of a black star.
text [98be58] = 她办公室的墙上缠满了红线，正中间是一颗黑色星星的草图。
# en: Follow the Hollow Star, and stay on good terms with her.
hint [8a228a] = 追查空洞之星，并和她保持好关系。

@fact nessa.press
# en: She would chain herself to the printing press before letting anyone shut the Ledger.
text [c72444] = 谁要是想关掉《流明纪事报》，她宁可把自己锁在印刷机上。

@fact nessa.off_record
# en: Her quill takes down everything, and stops for only two words: off the record.
text [2149b9] = 她的羽毛笔什么都记，只有两个词能让它停下：不予记录。
# en: Court her.
hint [01964b] = 追求她。

@fact nessa.planted
# en: She plants one error in every proof she asks you to check, to see whether you'll find it.
text [11da12] = 她让你校对的每一份校样里，都埋着一个错误，看你能不能找到。

@fact nessa.type
# en: She learned to set type backwards before she could write forwards, above her mother's press in the countryside. At the type case she doesn't say a single headline.
text [51951d] = 她还没学会正着写字，就先学会了反着排字，在乡下她母亲的印刷机楼上。站在字盘前，她一句标题都不说。
# en: Spend a break in the countryside, and call at the Almanac Printer's.
hint [ca9f58] = 假期去乡间，登门拜访历书印刷坊。

@fact nessa.first_story
# en: Her first story was a notice for a lost dog called Biscuit, set when she was seven. The dog came home. She has been unbearable ever since, and says it's the job.
text [64b490] = 她的第一篇报道是七岁时排的一张寻狗告示，狗叫饼干。狗回家了。从那以后她就让人受不了，她说这就是干这行的。
# en: Keep calling at the Almanac Printer's.
hint [36fa47] = 常去历书印刷坊。

@fact nessa.almanac
# en: Every seventh year the valley's almanac is printed a page short, always the harvest page. Her mother says the old press always did that. Nessa doesn't believe her.
text [1aa984] = 每七年，山谷的历书就会少印一页，总是收成那一页。她母亲说老印刷机一直这样。内莎不信。
# en: Call at the Almanac Printer's once you are friends.
hint [f0180d] = 成为朋友后去历书印刷坊。

@fact nessa.why_left
# en: She left the valley because nothing in it was ever news. Lately she wonders whether that was the news.
text [b4f9e7] = 她离开山谷，是因为这里从来没有新闻。最近她开始怀疑，那本身就是新闻。
# en: Spend a break in the countryside while you are on good terms.
hint [21c025] = 和她关系不错时，假期去乡间。
